 SIG20, Fn Type D and more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Over 100 new props and buildings for the Mission and Map Editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stay Tuned:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC is just the beginning! Brace for ongoing updates and improvements, promising exciting additions like new weapons, vehicles, uniforms, and missions in the future. Your journey through history is far from over!</p>","developers":["Marco Amadei"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1324780","name":"Easy Red 2"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499380/header.jpg?t=1743351093","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Intellectual property belong to Amadei Marco (Developer)</strong><br>Easy Red 2 is licensed for personal use. It is strictly forbidden to sell or distribute the software without the consent of Corvostudio.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117523,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117523/movie480.mp4?t=1742665894","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117523/movie_max.mp4?t=1742665894"},"name":"Shanghai - Nanking Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117523/3c9e1e7ae36b58fc725f5550fda9971f7b39e4c3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742665894","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117523/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742665894","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117523/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742665894"}}],"name":"Easy Red 2: Shanghai - Nanking","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":